Package: mdma
Title: Markdown Maker for LLMs
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
     person("Harald", "Puhr", email = "harald.puhr@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3308-9553"))
Description: Converts PDF files to Markdown for use with large language
    models. Text extraction relies on 'ragnar::read_as_markdown()', with
    automatic OCR fallback via 'tesseract' and 'pdftools' for image-based
    PDFs. A cleaning pipeline removes common PDF artefacts—page numbers,
    table-of-contents leaders, and soft hyphens—at three configurable
    intrusion levels.
